i config for edit tools\n* #1154: edits: add edit tool 'learning' for byok\n* #1163: Use apply_patch exclusively in msbench\n* #1150: Renamed chat commands\n* #1152: Wrap token check in catch\n* #1151: Fix auto-approve functionality in msbench\n* #1162: models - update description for `auto` when no auth\n* #1160: Consume new CAPI package\n* #1155: ensure workspace index is disabled for no auth, disable semantic search provider\n* #1159: Surface logging interface\n* #1146: nes: fix: better handle enforcing max budget\n* #1158: altAction: feat: show model-proposed next edit\n\nThis list of changes was [auto generated](https://dev.azure.com/monacotools/Monaco/_build/results?buildId=360498&view=logs).</details>"}}